{"3854860": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "FLOW STATE", "steam_appid": 3854860, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854860/extras/8771051d63da21caa500d7d8beeb0e20.poster.avif?t=1781061511\" width=476 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854860/extras/8771051d63da21caa500d7d8beeb0e20.webm?t=1781061511\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854860/extras/8771051d63da21caa500d7d8beeb0e20.mp4?t=1781061511\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FLOW STATE</strong> is a single-player speedrunning FPS that puts <strong>parkour and gunplay together</strong> for stylish, high-speed shootouts. Die, retry, and shave seconds off your time to climb the leaderboards as you get better with every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854860/extras/17ecad18d627cd0f5324b0939505c304.poster.avif?t=1781061511\" width=476 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854860/extras/17ecad18d627cd0f5324b0939505c304.webm?t=1781061511\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854860/extras/17ecad18d627cd0f5324b0939505c304.mp4?t=1781061511\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll <strong>slow time to land impossible shots</strong>, then slide around corners, wall-run across gaps, and blast through enemies midair. FLOW STATE is about <strong>feeling cool <i>and </i>improving</strong> every time you play.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854860/extras/149162320b87169b63377d2feac45f2f.avif?t=1781061511\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854860/extras_big/149162320b87169b63377d2feac45f2f.avif?t=1781061511 width=800 height=358 /></span><br>Racing against the clock will earn you medals, but that’s just the start. <strong>To</strong> <strong>climb the leaderboards</strong>, discover new routes that shave seconds off your fastest runs. Whether you’re an FPS pro or a speedrunning beginner, FLOW STATE makes you want to go again, and again… and again!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854860/extras/8771051d63da21caa500d7d8beeb0e20.poster.avif?t=1781061511\" width=476 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854860/extras/8771051d63da21caa500d7d8beeb0e20.webm?t=1781061511\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854860/extras/8771051d63da21caa500d7d8beeb0e20.mp4?t=1781061511\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FLOW STATE</strong> is a single-player speedrunning FPS that puts <strong>parkour and gunplay together</strong> for stylish, high-speed shootouts. Die, retry, and shave seconds off your time to climb the leaderboards as you get better with every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854860/extras/17ecad18d627cd0f5324b0939505c304.poster.avif?t=1781061511\" width=476 height=218 ><source src=\"h